  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDI Curtailing Illicit Child/Women trafficking    Fighting VAW, 2013-2016 - Curtailing Illicit Child/Women Trafficking,</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CDI Curtailing Illicit Child/Women trafficking    Fighting VAW, 2013-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this intervention has been &quot;to enhance capacities of civil society to conduct advocacy to improve the well-being of children, girls and women, with special measures to strengthen rights of migrants and to act against trafficking.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r ett samarbete med lokala CSOs.It adresser illegal barn   och flickor / kvinnor trafficking , vaiolence mot kvinnor ( VAW ) ,   flickor utbildning och arbetar f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka kvinnors ekonomiska        egenmakt ( WEE ) .Det kommer att ta itu med dessa problem genom att   h&#xf6;ja awarenessof den communityu regeringen om situationen , genom att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra inacting lagbest&#xe4;mmelser , st&#xf6;d till flickor utbildning .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is collaboration with local CSOs.It addresses illicit     child and girls/women trafficking, vaiolence against women (VAW),     girls education and works to enhance women economic empowerment       (WEE).It will address these problems by raising the awarenessof the   communityu government about the situation, through improving the      inacting of legislative provisions, support to girls education, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
